							</td>
							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=10.0">Rants and Raves</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1585.180#msg17464">Re: Did DN Ghost? Flames Galor...</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: June 04, 2005, 12:52:19 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Prodigy responds because he is a Warrior - both in his character, and in personality. A good Warrior does not ignore a threat. He stands in front of his friends, getting the crap kicked out of him to keep the others from the same fate. Well ... that is the way is is supposed to work, anyway. If any one on the DN raids is using cheats it is me. I have this incredible spell that will COMPLETELY heal a character in a mere 10 second blink of the eye. Shhhhhhhh.<br /><br />Revenos<br />Proud Cleric Applicant to Dawning Nemesis</td>
