								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1.0">General Discussion</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1453.75#msg16158">Re: Server Merges Starting</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: April 02, 2005, 05:13:26 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Is it only the huddled masses of RN refugees that have to worry about the &quot;x&quot; suffix, or has Sony described a process to decide which of two same-named characters gets to keep the name? Otherwise, someone on Quellious could create a character with the same name just to force the x-suffix on one of us.<br /><br />The Rev</td>
						</tr>
