								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1.0">General Discussion</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.3045#msg16157">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: April 02, 2005, 04:46:12 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Congratulations DN!! I know how hard you guys have worked to get there. Not many guilds could round up 95 members and apps these days for a raid. And it shows good discipline to have that many on a raid and not have someone screw it up.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm1.gif" alt="cwm1" border="0" /><br /><br />The Rev</td>
						</tr>
