						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Dwallion - In reference to a previous post, please do not use the word &quot;flavor&quot; in any sentence containing the phrase &quot;blow job&quot;. Thanks.<br /><br />The Rev</td>
