						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Gee ... I guess Outcast Adventurers must have disbanded without telling me. Typical.<br /><br />Revenos Aurelios<br />Cleric of Outcast Adventurers</td>
