							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: November 19, 2004, 12:11:38 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">It&#039;s not so much the loss of players at the end-game that is important, but the near-total-absence of players at the lower ends that is the problem. Have you tried to get a group together with you lower-level alt lately? Unless, EQ1 gets a tranfusion of new people to the game, it will die of natural causes.<br /><br />Revenos Aurelios<br />Mob Healer of Outcast Adventurers</td>
