							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: October 23, 2004, 11:37:39 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Good luck to you TA/JH.<br /><br />Take it from one who knows - it is really difficult for a casual guild to get to the elementals for the reasons that you spelled out. Don&#039;t give up, though. Keep the faith<br /><br />Revenos Aurelios<br />66th Archon of Outcast Adventurers</td>
