							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: October 15, 2004, 10:44:55 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Outcast Adventurers got Rallos Zek tonight. We are now Elemental.<br /><br />WOOT!<br /><br /><br />Revenos Aurelios<br />66Th Archon of Outcast Adventurers.</td>
