							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: August 05, 2004, 02:35:14 am
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Members of Outcast Adventurers just had their first fight tonight against Emperor Ssra We had 5 groups, about half of which were members of EiE, who were kind enough to guide us through the fight, and do most of the heavy lifting. You guys really, really rock. <br /><br />Thanks. Good on &#039;ya.<br /><br />Revenos Aurelios<br />65th Archon of Outcast Adventurers</td>
